            "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Human Form:</span> Nidalee throws her javelin, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/90/110/130/150 + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, increased up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(227.5/292.5/357.5/422.5/487.5 + ([[si:scaleap]]162.5% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> based on distance flown.",
