            "iconVersion": "16.18",
            "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Cougar Form:</span> Nidalee pounces, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(55/100/145/190 + ([[si:scalead]]50% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies surrounding where she lands. Killing a unit in <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Cougar Form</span> reduces this Ability's Cooldown to 3/2.5/2/1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Pouncing at a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hunted</span> enemy can be done from a greater distance and reduces this Ability's Cooldown to 3/2.5/2/1.5 seconds.",
